impl\n\n#### Output Buffer Allocation\n\n**Location: round0.rs:95-96**\n- **`sp_evals`** - DeviceBuffer<EF> (output evaluations)\n  - Size: `num_cosets as usize * skip_domain as usize`\n  - Allocated: `DeviceBuffer::<EF>::with_capacity(num_cosets as usize * skip_domain as usize)` (line 96)\n  - Calls chain: Same as above\n  - **Freed:** Returned to caller, managed by caller\n\n#### Memory Usage Check\n\n**Location: round0.rs:82-87**\n- Verifies: `intermed_capacity * sizeof(F) + temp_sums_buffer_capacity * sizeof(EF) <= max_temp_bytes`\n- **Note:** May exceed max_temp_bytes with warning (not an error)\n\n### **3. Inside `evaluate_round0_interactions_gpu` (round0.rs:132-275)**\n\n#### Interaction Weights Allocation (Host -> Device)\n\n**Location: round0.rs:204-206**\n- **`d_numer_weights`** - DeviceBuffer<EF>\n  - Size: `rules.rules.len() * sizeof(EF)`\n  - Source: `numer_weights.to_device()?` (line 204)\n  - Calls chain:\n    - `MemCopyH2D::to_device()` (copy.rs:89-93)\n    - → Creates new DeviceBuffer via `with_capacity(self.len())`\n    - → `d_malloc()` and `cudaMemcpyAsync` H2D\n  - **Freed:** On scope exit via Drop impl\n\n**Location: round0.rs:205**\n- **`d_denom_weights`** - DeviceBuffer<EF>\n  - Size: `rules.rules.len() * sizeof(EF)`\n  - Allocation: Same as `d_numer_weights` above\n  - **Freed:** On scope exit via Drop impl\n\n#### Encoded Rules Allocation (Host -> Device)\n\n**Location: round0.rs:209-210**\n- **`d_rules`** - DeviceBuffer<encoded rule type>\n  - Size: `rules.rules.len() * sizeof(encoded_rule)`\n  - Source: `encoded_rules.to_device()?` (line 210)\n  - Calls chain: Same as weights allocations\n  - **Freed:** On scope exit via Drop impl\n\n#### Intermediates Buffer Allocation\n\n**Location: round0.rs:222-227**\n- **`intermediates`** - DeviceBuffer<F> (logup interactions)\n  - Capacity: Computed by `_logup_r0_intermediates_buffer_size()` CUDA kernel call\n  - Allocated: `DeviceBuffer::<F>::with_capacity(intermed_capacity)` (line 224)\n  - Calls c